  "review_conclusion": "No newly demonstrated blocker in the reviewed CellRelay / LifecycleBroker production-callable paths; real build, actual broker invocation and installed lifecycle integration remain separate gates.",
  "confirmed_helper_defect": {
    "file": "host-admission-freeze-02/src/lib.rs",
    "symbol": "LeaseOwner::finish_retirement",
    "mechanism": "worker.take() consumes the join handle before a panic is returned as Err. No sticky poison is stored. A direct second invocation observes worker=None and returns Ok(true).",
    "evidence_level": "deterministic source path; no locally executed Rust panic control",
    "current_adapter_exposure": "Not reachable as false-success through CellRelay::serve: its first Err sets Poisoned and parks permanently. Bootstrap only uses CellRelay.",
    "author_response": "Inventory confirms no production direct helper caller in freeze03 and is adding sticky poison plus a real panic/retry control in the next separate revision."
  },
  "reviewed_properties": [
    "One accepted connection closes listener; per-authority service and enrollment latches survive failures and Arc clones.",
    "PendingGrant is stored before send_once; failure does not drop generation ownership. Admission retirement requires PSI worker completion.",
    "CellRelay reports retirement only after joining admission; panic poisons rather than releasing the process-wide slot.",
    "Process-wide slot replacement requires a retirement certificate and both exact prior owner/init pidfds dead; new Authority alone cannot reset it.",
    "Bootstrap channel verifies root socketpair creator credentials against exact current parent and SO_PEERPIDFD, arms parent-death signal and rechecks parent.",
    "All visible transferred SCM_RIGHTS are adopted by OwnedFd before decode/truncation/deadline errors; unexpected status/command rights are RAII-closed.",
    "Bound listener retains the exact private directory fd across threads; persistent O_EXCL claim is not removed on exit or error.",
    "LifecycleBroker owns child/control before initialize; errors preserve this ownership and one-shot attempt state.",
    "Status drain permits a final packet alongside HUP but validates nonce/scope/state and does not by itself certify retirement.",
    "Retire requires valid joined-worker RETIRED status plus exact child reap with matching exit code before setting the shared retirement flag.",
    "No reviewed path restores native direct PSI monitoring as a fallback after relay failure."
  ],
